   <title><![CDATA[“Christian” Nihilism in the U.S. Supreme Court? [God, Law, and Liberty]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>Today David examines Tennessee&rsquo;s attorney general's defense before the U.S. Supreme Court of the state&rsquo;s law prohibiting medical treatments for a minor&rsquo;s gender dysphoria. It&rsquo;s important to understand because it&rsquo;s the same argument Christian legal and policy advocates are using around the country. Are the arguments based on a nihilistic or biblical cosmology? Listen to find out.</p>]]></description>
